From: Otavio Salvador <otavio@ossystems.com.br>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 08:00:08 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 08/11] feat(web): ask to approve a project's .envrc and show
 whether direnv is on

A banner above the composer shows the .envrc, or the diff of a change, to approve, turn off, or
put off. The thread details panel shows On, Off or Needs approval when the project has one, and
Settings > Worktrees holds the project's direnv and trust-changes settings.
